    <task id="Id_aadb4660-f2b9-4fd8-82be-c89dd7e63540" name="5.3.7 Consolidar a resposta da equipe de entrega">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Consolidar todas as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es necess&amp;aacute;rias para responder ao convite de licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o garantindo que contenha o BEP (pr&amp;eacute;-contratual); a compet&amp;ecirc;ncia e capacidade da equipe de entrega; a proposta do plano de mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o; e a gest&amp;atilde;o de riscos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_d6e3d913-ac39-4cad-97ba-78650568e6a5</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_6fc235fe-3c50-4b8a-8e62-04d568a247e4</outgoing>
      <resourceRole id="Id_a3d15669-465f-4e45-8f71-f8692817d032">
        <q5:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q5="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">Empresas</q5:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_60b7494c-275a-4ec9-89c2-8c984084f781" name="5.3.6 Estabelecer o registro de riscos da equipe de entrega">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A poss&amp;iacute;vel licitante deve estabelecer o registro de riscos da equipe de entrega contendo os riscos associados &amp;agrave; entrega das informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es em tempo adequado, de acordo com os requisitos detroca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da contratante,e como a equipe de entrega pretende gerenciar estes riscos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Resumo das atividades da cl&amp;aacute;usula:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Identificar e avaliar os riscos associados ao gerenciamento e &amp;agrave; produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Decidir como combinar os riscos de gerenciamento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es com os outros riscos que est&amp;atilde;o sendo identificados&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Exemplos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Suposi&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Os riscos a serem considerados no registro de riscos da equipe de entrega podem, por exemplo, incluir o seguinte:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Exist&amp;ecirc;ncia, lacunas e adequa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do EIR recebido, e as medidas necess&amp;aacute;rias para solucion&amp;aacute;-las;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Impacto das fun&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e responsabilidades pelo gerenciamento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e como os requisitos de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es da contratante est&amp;atilde;o sendo capturados;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. Os riscos relacionados &amp;agrave;s informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es devem ser integrados em um &amp;uacute;nico risco. Por exemplo, o BEP n&amp;atilde;o deve apresentar um registro de risco suplementar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Marcos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Considere se h&amp;aacute; capacidade e habilidade suficientes para cumprir os marcos de entrega;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Considere os riscos de aquisi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o espec&amp;iacute;ficos do projeto. Por exemplo, os prazos de aquisi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de telecomunica&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es para os locais do projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Protocolo de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Considerar se os direitos e responsabilidades do protocolo s&amp;atilde;o aceit&amp;aacute;veis do ponto de vista jur&amp;iacute;dico e comercial&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Exist&amp;ecirc;ncia, lacunas e adequa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do protocolo que aborda os elementos listados na cl&amp;aacute;usula 5.1.8.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Estrat&amp;eacute;gia de fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Considere se um CDE apropriado foi estabelecido e sua capacidade de fornecer a estrat&amp;eacute;gia de fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Que toda a documenta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o relevante tenha sido acordada pela equipe de entrega e pela contratante e comunicada a todas as equipes de tarefas, conforme apropriado.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. Que o n&amp;iacute;vel de necessidade de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es seja definido e acordado para cada requisito de troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;4. Impacto da estrat&amp;eacute;gia de federa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do modelo de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e sua configura&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o no CDE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;5. Considere se a fase de mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o inclui todos os modelos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o configurados, testados e confirmados.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;M&amp;eacute;todos, procedimentos e padr&amp;otilde;es de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Considerar os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos propostos em rela&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &amp;agrave; organiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o existente/procedimentos internos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Considerar o impacto de quaisquer desvios dos processos existentes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. Considerar se os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos propostos s&amp;atilde;o vi&amp;aacute;veis e alcan&amp;ccedil;&amp;aacute;veis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;4. Avalie se a nomea&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o/convite para licita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o gerencia as mudan&amp;ccedil;as adequadamente, incluindo a altera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o cont&amp;iacute;nua da documenta&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de gerenciamento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es da nomea&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;5. Considere se os crit&amp;eacute;rios de conformidade s&amp;atilde;o mensur&amp;aacute;veis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, capacidade e habilidade&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Avaliar o impacto da comunica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Garantir que a considera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o dos prazos de entrega seja inclu&amp;iacute;da na mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, por exemplo:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;a) Aquisi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de CDE; b) Conex&amp;otilde;es de Internet/fornecimento de servi&amp;ccedil;os de Internet; c) Configura&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do sistema; d) Provedores de treinamento; e) Testes de CDE;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. Avaliar o impacto de um resultado negativo dos m&amp;eacute;todos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de teste e a lista real depender&amp;aacute; dos requisitos espec&amp;iacute;ficos da nomea&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
